    {
      "id": "sink/notification/inline-error",
      "source": "sink/notification.html",
      "name": "inline-error",
      "label": "Inline notification",
      "kind": "component",
      "slot": null,
      "line": 36,
      "provenance": "PROVENANCE: rendered-dom · react.carbondesignsystem.com, 2026-08-27 components-notifications-inline--default, --toast--default and --actionable--inline. All three variants diffed and matched. Three defects the diff found, none of which any name-based gate could see: TOAST put its icon inside __details. __details is display:block, so the icon stacked ABOVE the text instead of beside it and every toast was 38px too tall. React makes the icon a direct child of the root, which is a flex row. ACTIONABLE borrowed inline-notification__* for its wrappers. It has its own __focus-wrapper, __details, __text-wrapper and __content, all with real rules, and they were going unused. The action button carried --btn--sm without --layout--size-sm. --btn--sm sets border-radius and nothing else; the height comes from the layout class, so a \"small\" button was rendering at 48px. Same trap as --btn--lg in ui-shell.html: size is --layout--size-*, not --btn--<size>. The visually-hidden sentinels are copied because React renders them, but nothing here traps focus — they are markup fidelity, not behaviour, and Phase 5 is where they would start doing something.",
      "html": "    <div class=\"rux--inline-notification rux--inline-notification--error\" role=\"status\">\n      <div class=\"rux--inline-notification__details\">\n        <svg class=\"rux--inline-notification__icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-error--filled\"/></svg>\n        <div class=\"rux--inline-notification__text-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"rux--inline-notification__title\">Error</div>\n          <div class=\"rux--inline-notification__subtitle\">Something went wrong.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"rux--inline-notification__close-button\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n        <svg class=\"rux--inline-notification__close-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n"
    },
